    "detailed_description": "&quot;Nordland Mahjongg&quot; offers many hours of challenging gaming fun for both beginners and passionate Mahjongg players.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy different, hand-drawn tiles sets that can be coordinated with beautiful backgrounds. <br />\r\nMotifs from the Northland are available, as well as classic Chinese tiles and much more. <br />\r\nYou can look forward to three different Mahjongg variants, selectable perspectives of the tile display and many different Mahjongg boards. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe program is also ideal for bridging short breaks in an entertaining way.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n  - 3 different Mahjong game variants <br />\r\n  - Beautiful stone inserts and backgrounds<br />\r\n  - Many different mahjongg boards and adjustment possibilities <br />\r\n  - Choice of perspective and zoom<br />\r\n  - Hours of challenging entertainment",
